From: SuperVM <supervm@localhost>
Date: Tue, 28 Jul 2026 13:43:14 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] feat(castore/fs): cache blobs for DAX

Add DaxCache to materialize blobs as stable, digest-named host files for DAX
mappings. Atomic no-replace insertion lets concurrent daemons share one inode
and its host page-cache pages.

Change-Id: I6d6139b3e0d779b4c735c4859309237417c4dc74
---
